            "date": "Oct 9, 2026",
            "title": "I think about you all the time",
            "to": "Someone",
            "kind": "someone",
            "body": "<p class=\"script\">Dear you,</p><p>I think about you all the time. Not in the dramatic way people write about in songs, but in small, ordinary moments—the kind that arrive without warning and stay a little longer than they should.</p><p>I still reach for my phone when something makes me laugh. I still remember exactly how you took your coffee and the way you paused before saying something important.</p><p>Maybe I don’t need to send this. Maybe it is enough to finally let the words exist somewhere outside of me.</p><p class=\"script sm\">With all the things I never said,</p>",
            "paper": "img:corfu",
            "front": "img/uploads/feac5740f97e885e.jpg",
            "pfont": "",
            "pcolor": "#8a5a2b"
        },
        {
